From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sm64ar <sm64ar@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] DynOS packs

Makes DynOS model and texture packs safe and render-only for the AR host:

- with gArDynosPacksOnly, packs load prebuilt .tex/.bin files only (no
  PNG or source generation at boot), raw textures are checked before
  allocation and a malformed file is refused instead of being fatal;
- the host can approve each pack file before it loads
  (gArDynosPackFileAllowed); size bounds refuse absurd declared lengths and
  element counts past the end of a file;
- gfx_pc skips or clamps display-list commands that would index past its
  arrays or exceed its per-frame bounds, and counts them;
- model packs are render-only: an object keeps its vanilla graph, which
  still runs for the game state, and the pack's graph only draws, in a
  sandbox that puts back what drawing changed. 3D pack models of billboard
  objects can take the floor's tilt;
- a read-only packs folder bundled with the app is scanned after the user
  folder.

With gArDynosPacksOnly == false DynOS behaves as upstream.
